{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce942d6e7798eb08c7c0b08c9b3c7f3ead20523885809fa1c417b34375f0b34c", "ja": "（『アイドル紅白歌祭り』は、順調に進行している。\n麗花の支度ができてるか、様子を見にいってみよう）", "zh": "（《偶像红白歌祭》正在顺利进行。去看看丽花准备好没有吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1001_p", "source_sha256": "97c34226888ab956aad60c6944d7507e2406187fcf7ee8a2ea581e0dd0ab7931", "ja": "お疲れさま、麗花。\nそろそろ出番だけど、準備できてるか？", "zh": "辛苦了，丽花。\n差不多该你上场了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "467ba85753711c5fe70b80d3efa0d55dfc43cd0925a14d2331c29ae8bbf8d845", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n39分ぶりですね♪　準備はまだ全然です！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n时隔39分钟不见啦♪　还完全没准备好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1003_p", "source_sha256": "969a9e77c8ff2e6c5cb85404865434917c9d495d4da4bfffa7f482b715d1b121", "ja": "……えっ、そうなのか？\n見た感じ、大体できてるんじゃ……？", "zh": "……诶，是吗？\n看这阵势，感觉大体上已经差不多了啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "738e906032eb5202ed5e2b896b4e73ac80f152a6454384be116b0332006c62ba", "ja": "そんなことないですよ。みんなの歌声を聞いてると、\nワクワクドキドキしちゃって、もう大変です。", "zh": "不是那样的。听着大家的歌声，\n我就激动得心怦怦跳，简直不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "990ac6e170d77b72f66d5931b530c25841b18611ff736ac9835c092475e2067c", "ja": "大きな声でも出さないと、落ち着かないっていうか……", "zh": "要是不大声喊出来的话，就总觉得平静不下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1006_null", "source_sha256": "7ed9160677012ee3a81008d22d1ddf9a88ac459bee109f10f7c68b95e420ab2a", "ja": "（ワァァァァ……！　ワァァァァ……！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊啊……！哇啊啊啊啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1c62640151cd124c0eb6ac0e8b005c82db05cbb3b15cbc1136065bddfc612602", "ja": "なるほど……客席のみんなと同じってことか。\nここまで声が届いてくるもんな。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，和观众席上的大家一样啊。\n声音都传到这里来了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "cbda9981c0c36199a13431ce7802894612a1767526346c8898c4eade87c9bd89", "ja": "やっぱりそうですよね！　それじゃあ、\n私もこっそり客席に混ざってきます♪", "zh": "果然是这样对吧！那我也要\n悄悄混进观众席里去咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ba243e895bf8c078fb2f6b3b561fe0a0293dafb68f213a97acb766b124a23d03", "ja": "それはムリだ麗花！　絶対にバレるから、\nもう少しだけ我慢してくれ。", "zh": "那可不行，丽花！肯定会被发现的，再忍耐一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "fd01b21b7c3bf719c47dfa6653d760355560be5738a4656d16871191bb5ae9d7", "ja": "え～、そうですか？\nあ、じゃあじゃあ、もうここで歌っちゃいます♪", "zh": "诶～是这样吗？\n啊，那既然这样，我就在这里唱起来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1011_p", "source_sha256": "05285ab6fff4903f4fc686da54da89226feff3b0f0d8aefb775953ea35ee3efd", "ja": "えっ、ここで？\nまあ、発声練習みたいなもんか……。", "zh": "咦，就在这里？\n嗯，就当是发声练习吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "66d013db86e4721e5452e90ce0f0577880a0ac993e1c3447f5a68c0b31ec1b1a", "ja": "さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪\nわたしの和菓子、和三盆～♪", "zh": "三盆，和三盆，和三盆～♪\n我的和果子，和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "3d1cb9244b8de837c74f1947a8fb12f1d3cb7df6ebeb75c1eba4853e3ae63c65", "ja": "ふう……スッキリです。どうでしたか？\n私、普通に歌えてましたか？", "zh": "呼……舒服多了。怎么样？\n我刚才唱得还算正常吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2e88281b7c4369a80056aaea49f0016b4c7d5643a9a749bc6dcc3a2688bd9aeb", "ja": "ああ、普通によかったよ。\nその調子なら、本番もいけそうだな！", "zh": "啊，唱得挺好的。\n照这个状态，正式演出应该也没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "85aaa6288ab845388a5967ea721129d825748704a2cbe5726c11d8de063bee40", "ja": "わーい♪　次は{$P$}さんの番です。\nはい、どうぞ！", "zh": "太好啦♪　接下来轮到{$P$}先生了。\n来，请吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c3d0d46eb87967b71516fafeb9a7d1ee8a3c62bea91acce1fd231b88f683e89a", "ja": "え？　いや、俺は大丈夫。\n次は麗花が、みんなに歌を聞かせる番かな。", "zh": "咦？不用了，我没关系。\n接下来该轮到丽花给大家唱歌了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "08381f5d4e0ad90eef986891fbce52f9cbb43f5dd053d70bcf71291c7b846d58", "ja": "そうですか？　でもそれじゃ、\nずっと私の番になっちゃいますけど……。", "zh": "是吗？可是这样一来，就会一直轮到我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bb87166aad72832cbd5b2fab86a280630c607716765d6157e9d2b4846bb6f314", "ja": "そうだよ。歌う順番っていうのは、\nアイドルにしか回ってこないんだ。", "zh": "没错。轮到唱歌的机会，\n只有偶像才有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7788e93a1e1f210e3132d8a35379e9e021dee0ad760173b9ba8db092817be0a1", "ja": "歌でみんなを笑顔にするのが、アイドルだからな。", "zh": "因为偶像就是要用歌声让大家露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "6d444e703b388554f63e8d61e0e58f233c923030a9dc569ef08a05d93f9179b5", "ja": "わぁ……ふふっ。\n素敵な言葉をありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇……呵呵。\n谢谢你说出这么棒的话♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "2ad4250435662d7919f2b7e90ddf783b5f36736313f869f335a2bdd4422505d9", "ja": "というわけで、ステキデューサーさんのおかげで、\n準備はすっかりバッチリです。いつでも行けますよ！", "zh": "所以，多亏了超棒的制作人，准备工作已经万事俱备了。随时都可以出发哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1022_p", "source_sha256": "dfaa7ff83d2626b6e86e944644e62cf3f1a73615ed82d806383cbe441379661f", "ja": "それはよかった。時間的にもそろそろだな。\nよし、舞台袖に移動するか！", "zh": "那太好了。从时间上看也差不多了。\n好，我们去舞台侧边吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "45e8cc9c024ba3b510ef3f576840644b42c7fa9cbfef30bac80fdd65db27eb9f", "ja": "はーい！　私も素敵な歌をたくさん届けて、\nたくさん笑顔になってもらいますね。", "zh": "好——！我也会送上许多动听的歌声，让大家绽放出许多笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0154_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "b9f94fed0a2f3e54c809aeb498b8a08f21f0681fd3bc5a46686fcf83552e0337", "ja": "素敵な言葉でたくさんの笑顔をくれる、\n{$P$}さんみたいに……。ふふっ♪", "zh": "像{$P$}先生一样，用美妙的话语带给大家许多笑容……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
